<title>UK: Morgan Stanley sets warrants on Lufthansa.</title>
<headline>Morgan Stanley sets warrants on Lufthansa.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley Wertpapier GmbH has</p>
<p>issued 20 million American-style call warrants, in two equal</p>
<p>tranches, on Deutsche Lufthansa AG, lead manager Morgan Stanley</p>
<p>Bank AG said.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one share.</p>
<p> WARRANTS	STRIKE	ISS PRICE	PREMIUM	GEARING</p>
<p> CALL A	  20.50	 2.59 DEM	 12.63 PCT    7.92 X</p>
<p> CALL B	  21.53	 2.22 DEM	 15.83 PCT    9.23 X</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 10.JAN.97-12.JUN.98   PAYDATE	10.JAN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   FRANKFURT		 MIN EXER LOT 1000</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  20.50 DEM</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
